INSERT INTO `dupe_gene_note` VALUES (2,'2019-10-01 14:55:51','William Lees','From Mats:\n\nUnfortunately we could not use submissions S00006 for inference of IGHV3-43D*i01 as the VH3-specific primers used in this study extended into FR1. In IARC Minutes of Meeting 31 we wrote (on the topic of other alleles) that \"The committee noted that the submitted IGHV1-8 variant is now recognized by IMGT as IGHV1-8*03. The submitted IGHV2-70 variant is now recognized by IMGT as IGHV2-70*15.\" Now further actions were taken. Although IGHV3-43D*i01 (IGHV3-43D*04) is never addressed as we assessed submission S00008 I guess we used similar reasoning not to address it further. We have lately discussed moving alleles to level 3 independent of IMGT recognition (as IMGT will accept inferred alleles already at level 1). \n\nWe should probably reopen this case and evaluate this allele in S00008.',19,402),(3,'2019-10-01 14:56:02','William Lees','From Mats:\n\nUnfortunately we could not use submissions S00006 for inference of IGHV3-43D*i01 as the VH3-specific primers used in this study extended into FR1. In IARC Minutes of Meeting 31 we wrote (on the topic of other alleles) that \"The committee noted that the submitted IGHV1-8 variant is now recognized by IMGT as IGHV1-8*03. The submitted IGHV2-70 variant is now recognized by IMGT as IGHV2-70*15.\" Now further actions were taken. Although IGHV3-43D*i01 (IGHV3-43D*04) is never addressed as we assessed submission S00008 I guess we used similar reasoning not to address it further. We have lately discussed moving alleles to level 3 independent of IMGT recognition (as IMGT will accept inferred alleles already at level 1). \n\nWe should probably reopen this case and evaluate this allele in S00008.',19,662),(4,'2019-10-01 14:56:51','William Lees','From Mats:\n\nSubmission S00015 is a resubmission of data from LP08248 (now with IGHJ4-based haplotyping) also used in submission S00007 that was already used for inference of this allele. This submission can thus not be used as further evidence of this allele.',34,1053),(5,'2019-10-01 14:57:21','William Lees','From Mats:\n\nSubmission S00015 is a resubmission of data from LP08248 (now with IGHJ4-based haplotyping) also used in submission S00007 that was already used for inference of this allele. This submission can thus not be used as further evidence of this allele.',35,1057);
